ent, and for State and local governments, 70 percent. Data were first published for banks and insurance companies in the May 1941 Treasury\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 3, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [815, 222, 1538, 323], \"page_id\": 83}], \"content\": \"ury Bulletin, for corporations and savings and loan associations in the September 1960 Bulletin, and for State and local governments in the February 1962 Bulletin.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 4, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [816, 374, 1541, 538], \"page_id\": 83}], \"content\": \"Holdings by commercial banks distributed according to Federal Reserve member bank classes and nonmember banks are published for June 30 and December 31. Holdings by corporate pension trust funds are published quarterly, first appearing in the March 1954 Bulletin.\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 5, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [518, 943, 1071, 967], \"page_id\": 83}], \"content\": \"Table TSO-1. - Summary of Federal Securities\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 6, \"type\": \"title\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [608, 1003, 976, 1032], \"page_id\": 83}], \"content\": \"(Par values - in millions of dollars)\", \"description\": null, \"id\": 7, \"type\": \"text\"}, {\"bbox\": [{\"coord\": [20, 1034, 1561, 1885], \"page_id\": 83}], \"content\": \"<table><tr><th>Classification</th><th>Total amount outstanding 1/</th><th>U.S. Government accounts and Federal Reserve banks</th><th>Total private investors</th><th colspan=\\\"6\\\">Held by private investors covered in Treasury Survey</th><th>All other private investors 2/</th></tr><tr><th></th><th></th><th></th><th></th><th>5,797 commercial banks 2/</th><th>497 mutual savings banks 2/</th><th>Insurance companies 293 life</th><th>460 fire, casualty, and marine</th><th>488 savings and loan associations</th><th>469 corporations</th><th>State and local governments 316 general funds</th><th>187 pension and retirement funds</th><th></th></tr><tr><t